WonderLab · 万象生

This product includes software from YUHA (https://github.com/lth2015/yuha),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, stewarded by the NETX
technical community. The ported parts — sign-in and sessions, the staff second
factor (TOTP), Stripe and stablecoin payments, the credits ledger, their
database migrations and tests — live under server/, with the matching account
screens under src/account and src/lib, and were adapted for WonderLab
(yuha-only features such as songs, the market licence and e-mail notices were
removed). A copy of
the Apache License 2.0 is in server/YUHA-LICENSE.

The poetic typeface is LXGW WenKai (https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai),
subset in src/assets/fonts, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(src/assets/fonts/OFL-LXGW-WenKai.txt).
